{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32979","headline":"杏园即席上同年 · 曹邺","name":"杏园即席上同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岐路不在天，十年行不至。\n一旦公道开，青云在平地。\n枕上数声鼓，衡门已如市。\n白日探得珠，不待骊龙睡。\n怱怱出九衢，僮仆颜色异。\n故衣未及换，尚有去年泪。\n晴阳照花影，落絮浮野翠。\n对酒时忽惊，犹疑梦中事。\n自怜孤飞鸟，得接鸾凤翅。\n永怀共济心，莫起胡越意。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}